    "body": "Thanks Kurt!\n\nI want to point out what I think is a critical detail: we _already_ have cross-scope style sharing in the form of `adoptedStyleSheets`. What we're looking for is a way to serialize and deserialize `adoptedStyleSheets` to and from HTML without JavaScript.",
